This repository contains:
  - Device tree source files derived from OpenWrt (GPL-2.0-only OR MIT)
  - Build patches for OpenWrt source tree (GPL-2.0-only)
  - Prebuilt binary images, see images/packages.manifest for package licenses
  - Documentation in docs/ (GPL-2.0-only, same as project)

Full GPL-2.0 license text:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.txt

The OpenWrt project source is at https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt and is the
primary source of all kernel and OpenWrt-shipped components in the binary
images. This repository only provides additions and modifications to support
the Aruba IAP-305 hardware.
